$il$CHECK 2 HAS MOVED ON, ANOTHER PIECE ANSWERED. The Sent tab has gone from 846 to 847 and All from 1128 to 1129. Nothing has been sent through Lovable today because Send now is down, see i082, so the one new sent touch is the Frank Pelzer InMail written by hand. The row now counts in Sent and in All, on top of appearing on the Outreach tab as FIRST MESSAGE 1.

STILL UNCHECKED, and these are the ones that matter: whether the day seven reply check is scheduled off 17 September, whether the sequence position on the next draft for this contact reads correctly, whether the InMail credit moved, and whether a later sync will insert the same InMail a second time because this row carries no LinkedIn message id.$il$
